# Build context for the images that build from infra/ itself rather than their
# own directory — weasyprint and typst, so both can COPY the shared fonts/
# tree. An allowlist, because infra/ also holds .env with the stack's secrets,
# which must never be sent to a build.
#
# Images that build from their own directory (kratos, hydra, scripts, mermaid)
# have their own context root and never read this file.

*
!fonts
!weasyprint
!typst

# Local-only state inside the allowed directories.
typst/node_modules
typst/vendor
weasyprint/fonts
